{"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"search"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"title":"search","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK11PageRequestV6searchSSSgvp"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/pagerequest\/search"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"search","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Matched case-insensitively against the identifying fields of whatever is being"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"listed — a name or username, plus the record id, so a UUID out of a log line can be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pasted in as-is. Which fields exactly is the server’s business; "},{"code":"Page.total","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" then"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"counts MATCHES rather than rows, which is what lets a pager built on it show a page"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"count belonging to the result set it is paging."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It lives here, beside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"offset"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"limit"},{"type":"text","text":", rather than as an extra argument on each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the twenty generated "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"list"},{"type":"text","text":" methods (§27.4 rule 4). That is what makes "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"next()"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"carry it, and so what makes a manual walk filter the WHOLE walk: one that sent the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"term on its first request and dropped it on the second would return the matches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"followed by the unfiltered tail, which reads as a server bug from the caller’s side."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Stored as the caller gave it; "},{"code":"queryPairs","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is where it is normalised."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/PageRequest\/search"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/PageRequest"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A free-text filter applied by the SERVER, before "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"offset"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"limit"},{"type":"text","text":", or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" for none."}],"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management)."}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk","title":"AxiamSDK","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/PageRequest/search":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/PageRequest\/search","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"search","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A free-text filter applied by the SERVER, before ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"offset"},{"text":"\/","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"limit"},{"text":", or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":" for none.","type":"text"}],"title":"search","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/pagerequest\/search","role":"symbol"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/PageRequest":{"role":"symbol","title":"PageRequest","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/pagerequest","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PageRequest"}],"abstract":[{"text":"One page’s worth of ","type":"text"},{"code":"?offset=","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"\/","type":"text"},{"code":"?limit=","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/PageRequest","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PageRequest"}],"type":"topic"}}}